<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n87750" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προκατ-εργάζομαι</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>subdue first,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινα</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				D.C.
				43.4
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>prepare beforehand,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>CP</u>
				3.20.8
			</span></i>, al.; <i>work up beforehand,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ ψυχικὸν πνεῦμα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Gal.
					<u>UP</u>
					8.10
				</span></i>
			; <i>do</i> or <i>perform beforehand,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χρήσιμον π. ἔργον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.S.
					30.8
				</span></i>
			:—pf.
			
				Pass.
			, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				4.17
			</span></i>; <i>to be prepared,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				J.
				<u>AJ</u>
				19.1.14
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
			</span></i><i>Comp. Demetr.Ant.</i><i><span class="en">
				1
			</span></i>: aor.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προκατειργάσθην</span> only in pass.
			sense, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ταῖς -ασθείσαις πράξεσι</span>”
				<i>already performed,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.S.
					1.53
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ασθεὶς τῇ μάχῃ</span>”
				<i>worn out, exhausted,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Paus.
					6.6.5
				</span></i>
			; of food, <i>digested,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				1.655
			</span></i>.</div>
